<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="zh-CN"><voice name="zh-CN-YunjianNeural"><mstts:express-as style="sports_commentary" styledegree="1.08"><prosody rate="-2%">进圆形漏斗了，先看谁更靠近中心落孔。青岚还在外圈打转，翠羽已经贴近出口；别看入碗时差了半圈，现在反而是翠羽占先。</prosody></mstts:express-as></voice></speak>